d_at": ""}, {"path": "/@agatha/works/9", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/0dec6095/uploads/origins/9e2a4cf4-1454-4288-9242-bb0fea8e643d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=92623d5966131a4f1ac1a836b66d47a1", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0dec6095/uploads/origins/9e2a4cf4-1454-4288-9242-bb0fea8e643d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=92623d5966131a4f1ac1a836b66d47a1, https://si.imgix.net/0dec6095/uploads/origins/9e2a4cf4-1454-4288-9242-bb0fea8e643d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=76c2dc7ebf4caaab6c339e7ea5046c0d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0dec6095/uploads/origins/9e2a4cf4-1454-4288-9242-bb0fea8e643d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=92508943383efe3a8dab321ca84dc657 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、初めてスケブ依頼させていただきます。\nお題、櫻歌ミコ第1、第2に挟まるケモ耳ロリのイラストをお願いしたいです。\n構図やその他はおにく先生のイメージにお任せ致します。\nよろしくお願いします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@agatha/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ce93bd36/uploads/origins/a73ddde9-0f7a-4e01-95ae-d2b74aa6f51d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2ca01d902b99f9089916a5d6dbfcebdf", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ce93bd36/uploads/origins/a73ddde9-0f7a-4e01-95ae-d2b74aa6f51d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2ca01d902b99f9089916a5d6dbfcebdf, https://si.imgix.net/ce93bd36/uploads/origins/a73ddde9-0f7a-4e01-95ae-d2b74aa6f51d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dfe40bf51a20301d7ac42742e3da8200 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ce93bd36/uploads/origins/a73ddde9-0f7a-4e01-95ae-d2b74aa6f51d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4156ec11ed4940d6e0788ec6e384150f 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "お疲れ様です。秋春ものと申します。\n縣先生のことは、いつぞやの櫻歌ミコお誕生会ニコ生から存じていたのですが、\n最近までTwitte